desc:
4 Bedrooms, 1 Full Bathroom, unfurnished GROUND floor suite. 
Interior renovation are now completed and it's available ANYTIME or by April 15th, 2026.
Rent is $2,800 per month which include all utilities (BC Hydro/Fortis BC) and FREE Wi-Fi.
This suite comes with one parking spot on the back.

** Excellent Location **
On E. 12th Avenue & Woodland, less than 5 min walk to Commercial-Broadway Skytrain station. 
Bus transit nearby. Close to VCC (10-15 min walk), Safeway and many groceries store nearby.

** BRAND NEW remodeled suite **
- BRAND NEW marble tile floor throughout the apartment including bathroom and kitchen. 
- BRAND NEW hardwood flooring in bedrooms. NO Carpet;
- BRAND NEW Kitchen: which features NEW granite countertop and NEW wall tiles;
- BRAND NEW Stainless steel appliances: Fridge, gas range oven & Dishwasher (!). Large kitchen sink with spray faucet;
- BRAND NEW Bathroom with NEW walk-in glass shower (marble tiles floor to ceiling), NEW 72" Vanity w/ double sink, NEW toilet, Chrome hardware;
- BRAND NEW LED lighting throughout (no need to change a light bulb ever);
- The whole suite has been repainted and re-sealed;
- Double-thick windows everywhere;
- All Bedrooms can fit a queen size bed and 3 has their own build-in closet;
- This suite has 2 private entrance and a semi-private covered porch area.

** House features **
- Character house with unique charm;
- Covered back porch with concrete flooring;
- Backyard with real grass and gardening area;
- Open back space for car parking;

** Conditions **
- We are looking for quiet & responsible tenant(s) who will respect the property and the neighbors;
- Sorry no party, no smoking in-room;
- Max occupancy 4 persons;
- 1 small pet might be considered (case to case basis);
- Available ANYTIME or by April 15th, 2026;
- Minimum 1 year standard Lease.



* PLEASE * If you are interested, please reply and tell us a little bit about your situation.




